  "project_decision": "HOLD for automated ingestion and V2 inference. The provider's 2026-10-08 Dataset Licence permits manual exports and private non-commercial ML research, but expressly prohibits automated scraping, crawling and automated CSV/dataset downloads without separate written authorization. The reviewed Serie A match table documents candidate fields for 17 of 19 frozen features (scores/points, corners, yellow cards); the two red-card features are not documented. Coverage, upstream field rights, and per-match source/correction times remain unverified. Do not automate access, download data, calculate features or infer until written automated-access permission, full 19-feature coverage, upstream rights and source-before-quote provenance are established."
